}, {"t_ms": 49855, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01N22eg18RjMYRGE3FDYtJJQ", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49855, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01N22eg18RjMYRGE3FDYtJJQ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 51858, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again (error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002).\n\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt to roll back to v2.3.0 failed partway through with an orchestrator error. us-east had moved to v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1. I retried once and it completed in all regions.\n- **Version choice:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 are both marked unhealthy, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Incident:** SEV2 incident **INC-0001** is open for checkout-api. The first request to open it timed out, but the incident had been created, so I didn't open a duplicate. Its summary covers the partial failure, the retry, and the current state.\n\nFollow-up: someone should find out why v2.3.1 failed and why the first rollback only partially applied before v2.3.1 is re-released.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Y57hsaYzLQVTQnYw9yF4cX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01EmZHaWEZeiSKmLTNgEJR2u", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thin